  "question": {
    "text": "The mean free path of molecules of a certain gas at STP is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1500</mn><mi>d</mi></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>is the diameter of the gas molecules. While maintaining the standard pressure, the mean free path of the molecules at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>373</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>K</mi></math> is approximately:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>750</mn><mi>d</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1098</mn><mi>d</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2049</mn><mi>d</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1500</mn><mi>d</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The mean free path is given by the relation,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mi>T</mi></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>&nbsp;be the new mean free path.</p><p>Hence,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1500</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>273</mn><mn>373</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2049</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>45</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>2049</mn><mi>d</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
